Run the website locally (two terminals):

Terminal 1 — Backend:
    cd server
    npm start
    (starts on http://localhost:3000, connects to Supabase Postgres)

Terminal 2 — Frontend:
    cd frontend
    npm run dev
    (open http://localhost:5173)

Admin login (set in server/.env, account auto-created on first server start):
    email:    the ADMIN_EMAIL you configured
    password: the ADMIN_PASSWORD you configured

Note: MongoDB is no longer used — the database is Postgres on Supabase.
See "installation-guide" for full setup instructions.
